## Code Review Report — Past 24 Hours

### Commits reviewed (11)
Design system track work: Stack, Grid, Header, Footer, Breadcrumb components added + CSS style fix across all components.

### Files reviewed (27 source + test files)

| File | Issues Found |
|------|-------------|
| `src/Design/Card.elm` | Double semicolons in headerStyleValue/footerStyleValue CSS strings |
| `src/Design/Breadcrumb.elm` | Dead first parameter `List a` ignored in `breadcrumb` function |
| `src/Design/Grid.elm` | `tabletColumns`/`desktopColumns` attrs computed but never applied (responsive grid is broken) |
| `src/Design/Spinner.elm` | `@keyframes spin` never injected into DOM (known, open in tech-debt) |
| All test files | All use `Expect.pass` — no real assertions on rendered output |
| 28 files | elm-format violations |

### Issues Fixed
1. **28 elm-format violations** — auto-formatted all source and test files
2. **Card.elm double semicolons** — removed extra `;` between background-color and font-size in headerStyleValue and footerStyleValue
3. **Breadcrumb.elm dead parameter** — removed unused `List a` first parameter, updated tests

### Architectural Concerns (noted in tech-debt.md)
1. **Grid.elm responsive columns are dead code** — `tabletColumns`/`desktopColumns` are accepted as attrs but never rendered. Only `columns` is used in `grid-template-columns`. (Medium)
2. **All design-system tests are smoke tests** — every test uses `Expect.pass` without asserting actual HTML/style output. Should validate rendered attributes. (Medium)
3. **Mixed style application approach** — Button.elm mixes `attribute "style" string` and `style` individual property calls. Should standardize. (Low)

